#: kcookiespolicies.cpp:449
msgid ""
"<h1>Cookies</h1> Cookies contain information that Konqueror (or any other KDE "
"application using the HTTP protocol) stores on your computer from a remote "
"Internet server. This means that a web server can store information about you "
"and your browsing activities on your machine for later use. You might consider "
"this an invasion of privacy."
"<p>However, cookies are useful in certain situations. For example, they are "
"often used by Internet shops, so you can 'put things into a shopping basket'. "
"Some sites require you have a browser that supports cookies."
"<p>Because most people want a compromise between privacy and the benefits "
"cookies offer, KDE offers you the ability to customize the way it handles "
"cookies. You might, for example want to set KDE's default policy to ask you "
"whenever a server wants to set a cookie or simply reject or accept everything. "
"For example, you might choose to accept all cookies from your favorite shopping "
"web site. For this all you have to do is either browse to that particular site "
"and when you are presented with the cookie dialog box, click on <i> "
"This domain </i> under the 'apply to' tab and choose accept or simply specify "
"the name of the site in the <i> Domain Specific Policy </i> "
"tab and set it to accept. This enables you to receive cookies from trusted web "
"sites without being asked every time KDE receives a cookie."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Cookie'lar</h1> Cookie'lar Konqueror (yä ki HTTP protokolın qullanğan başqa "
"KDE yazılımnarı) tarafınnan sanağıñda saqlanğan häm yıraq İnternet serverları "
"tarafınnan qullanılğan mäğlümätne saqlílar. Yäğni web-server sineñ häm gizgän "
"urınnarıñ turında sanağıñda soñraq qullanır öçen mäğlümät saqlí ala. Monı "
"xosusílıqqa höcüm dip saní alasıñ. "
"<p> Läkin bilgele oçraqlarda faydalı da bula ala. Mäsälän, cookie'lardan yış "
"qına internet-kibetlär faydalana: bu uñaydan sin äyberlärne 'säwdä kärzinenä "
"sala' alasıñ. Qayber säxifälär cookie terägän gizgeç qullanunı täläp itälär. "
"<p> Härxäldä keşelärne kübese xosusílıq belän cookie kitergän fayda arasında "
"ber kompromis tabarğa teli. KDE cookielarğa qarata qılanışın bilgeläw "
"mömkinlegen birä. Şulay itep KDE'nıñ bar bulğan säyäsäten berär server cookie "
"urnaştırırğa telägän sayın sineñ röxsäteñne sorawğa yä ki bar cookie'larnı "
"qabul itü yä kire qağuğa köylärgä mömkin. Mäsälän, sin ışanğan yaratqan "
"alış-bireş säxifäläre öçen härwaqıt cookie aluğa röxsät soramíça kerü säyäsäten "
"bilgeli alasıñ. Monı eşlär öçen şul säxifägä kilep cookie dialog tartmasın "
"kürep 'aşır' yafrağındağı <i> Bu damain </i>ğa bas ta qabul itüne sayla. Yäisä "
"<i> Domenğa Bäyle Säyäsät </i> yafrağında säxifä isemen bilgelä häm qabul "
"itelüen sayla. Bu ışanıçlı säxifälärdän cookie yöklär öçen härwaqıt röxsät "
"soralmağan bulunı tä'min itä."

