#: main.cpp:85
msgid ""
"<h1>Local Network Browsing</h1>Here you setup your <b>"
"\"Network Neighborhood\"</b>. You can use either the LISa daemon and the lan:/ "
"ioslave, or the ResLISa daemon and the rlan:/ ioslave."
"<br>"
"<br>About the <b>LAN ioslave</b> configuration:"
"<br> If you select it, the ioslave, <i>if available</i>"
", will check whether the host supports this service when you open this host. "
"Please note that paranoid people might consider even this to be an attack."
"<br><i>Always</i> means that you will always see the links for the services, "
"regardless of whether they are actually offered by the host. <i>Never</i> "
"means that you will never have the links to the services. In both cases you "
"will not contact the host, so nobody will ever regard you as an attacker."
"<br>"
"<br>More information about <b>LISa</b> can be found at <a "
"href=\"http://lisa-home.sourceforge.net\">the LISa Homepage</a> "
"or contact Alexander Neundorf &lt;<a href=\"mailto:neundorf@kde.org\">"
"neundorf@kde.org</a>&gt;."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Cirle Çeltär Taraw</h1>Monda <b>\"Çeltär Kürşeläre\"</b>"
"ñne köylärgä bula. Yä LISa programı yärdäme belän lan:/ ioslave, yäisä ResLISa "
"programı yärdäme belän rlan:/ ioslave qullana alasıñ."
"<br>"
"<br><b>LAN ioslave</b> tezeleşe turında: "
"<br>Anı saylasañ, qullanırlıq bulsa, sin berär xucağa totaşqanda ul bu xucanıñ "
"bu xezmät totuın tikşerer. Qayber paranoid keşelär monı höcümgä saní alğanın "
"zínhar istä totası."
"<br><i>Härwaqıt</i> xucanıñ qayber xezmätlärne täqdim itü-itmäwenä qaramíça "
"sineñ xezmätlärgä sıltamalarnı härwaqıt küräçägeñne añlata. <i>Berqayçan da</i> "
"bu xezmätlärgä sıltama berqayçan da kürmäyäçägeñne añlata. İke oçraqta da sin "
"xuca belän elemtägä kermässeñ, şuña kürä sine berkem dä höcümçe dip sanamas."
"<br>"
"<br><b>LISa<b> turında bäynä-bäynä mäğlümät <a "
"href=\"http://lisa-home.sourceforge.net\">LISa Ana Bite</a>"
"ndä yä ki Alexander Neundorftan &lt;<a href=\"mailto:neundorf@kde.org\">"
"neundorf@kde.org</a> alırğa mömkin&gt;."

