msgid "Only acce&pt cookies from originating server"
msgstr "Üzäk serverdan kilgän cookielarnı ğına &qabul it."

#. i18n: file kcookiespoliciesdlg_ui.ui line 54
#: rc.cpp:177
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"Reject the so called third-party cookies. These are cookies that originate from "
"a site other than the one you are currently browsing. For example, if you visit "
"<b>www.foobar.com</b> while this option is on, only cookies that originate from "
"www.foobar.com will be processed per your settings. Cookies from any other site "
"will be rejected. This reduces the chances of site operators compiling a "
"profile about your daily browsing habits.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"Öçençe zat cookieların kire qaq. Bolar - sin qarağan säxifäneñ tışında yasalğan "
"cookielar. Mäsälän sin, östäge saylanma açıq bulğan kileş, <b>"
"www.soft.beznen.net</b> 'qa keräseñ, bu oçraqta www.soft.beznen.net'ta yasalğan "
"cookielar ğına köylämäläreña qarap qabul iteler. Başqa säxifälärneñ cookieları "
"kire qağılaçaq. Bu, säxifä citäkçeläreneñ köndälek gizü ğädäteñne öyränüdän "
"totqarlí.\n"
"</qt>"

#. i18n: file kcookiespoliciesdlg_ui.ui line 62
#: rc.cpp:182
#, no-c-format
msgid "Automaticall&y accept session cookies"
msgstr "Utırış cookieların automat&ik qabul it."

#. i18n: file kcookiespoliciesdlg_ui.ui line 68
#: rc.cpp:185
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"Automatically accept temporary cookies meant to expire at the end of the "
"current session. Such cookies will not be stored in your computer's hard drive "
"or storage device. Instead, they are deleted when you close all applications "
"(e.g. your browser) that use them."
"<p>\n"
"<u>NOTE:</u> Checking this option along with the next one will override your "
"default as well as site specific cookie policies. However, doing so also "
"increases your privacy since all cookies will be removed when the current "
"session ends.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\n"
"Xäzerge utırış soñında yuq bulaçaq waqıtlı cookielarnı automatik räweştä qabul "
"it. Andí cookie'lar sanağıñnıñ qatı diskında yä ki saqlaw caylanmasında "
"saqlanmayaçaq, ämmä alarnı qullanğan böten yazılımnar (ü.ö. gizgeçeñ) "
"yabıluınnan soñ taşlanaçaq."
"<p>\n"
"<u>İSTÄ TOT:</u>Bu saylanma belän kiläsen tamğalaw bar bulğan häm xättä "
"säxifägä bäyle cookie säyäsätläreñnän östen bulaçaq. Härxäldä böten "
"cookielarnıñ utırış soñında taşlanuı xosusílıqnı da arttıra.\n"
"</qt>"

#. i18n: file kcookiespoliciesdlg_ui.ui line 76
#: rc.cpp:191
#, no-c-format
msgid "Treat &all cookies as session cookies"
msgstr "Böten cookielar belän w&aqıtlı cookie belän kebek qılan"

#. i18n: file kcookiespoliciesdlg_ui.ui line 82
#: rc.cpp:194
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<qt>\n"
"Treat all cookies as session cookies. Session cookies are small pieces of data "
"that are temporarily stored in your computer's memory until you quit or close "
"all applications (e.g. your browser) that use them. Unlike regular cookies, "
"session cookies are never stored on your hard drive or other storage medium."
"<p>\n"
"<u>NOTE:</u> Checking this option along with the previous one will override "
"your default as well as site specific cookie policies. However, doing so also "
"increases your privacy since all cookies will be removed when the current "
"session ends.\n"
"</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt> Böten cookielar belän utırış cookieları belän kebek qılan. Utırış "
"cookieları - sanağıñda waqıtlıça saqlanğan keçkenä mäğlümät kisäkläre, alarnı "
"qullanuçı böten yazılımnar (ü.ö. gizgeçeñ) yabılğannan soñ alar yuq bulalar. "
"Ğädäti cookielardan ayırmaları - qatı disk yä başqa saqlaw urtamında berqayçan "
"da saqlanmawları."
"<p>\n"
"<u>İSTÄ TOT:</u>Bu saylanma belän aldağısın tamğalaw bar bulğan häm xättä "
"säxifägä bäyle cookie säyäsätläreñnän östen bulaçaq. Härxäldä böten "
"cookielarnıñ utırış soñında taşlanuı xosusílıqnı da arttıra.\n"
"</qt>"

