#: socks.cpp:270
msgid ""
"<h1>SOCKS</h1>"
"<p>This module allows you to configure KDE support for a SOCKS server or "
"proxy.</p>"
"<p>SOCKS is a protocol to traverse firewalls as described in <a "
"href=\"http://rfc.net/rfc1928.html\">RFC 1928</a>. "
"<p>If you have no idea what this is and if your system administrator does not "
"tell you to use it, leave it disabled.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>SOCKS</h1>KDE'nıñ SOCKS/proxy server toruın bonda köyläp mömkin.</p>"
"<p>SOCKS, <a href=\"http://rfc.net/rfc1928.html\">RFC 1928</a> "
"añlatılğança, saqlıq díwarlar aşa küçü öçen qullanılğan protokol. "
"<p>Anıñ närsä ikänen belmäsäñ häm sistem idäräçesennän anıñ qullanışına "
"qağılğan üteneçlär almasañ, anı sälätsez qaldır.</p>"

